<title>USA: U.S business inventories data release time changed.</title>
<headline>U.S business inventories data release time changed.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commerce Department said it will begin issuing its monthly report on business inventories and sales at 0830 EST instead of at 1000.</p>
<p>The time change will commence with the next report to be issued on January 15.</p>
</text>
